  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for GameSphere', 'description': 'Primary container for GameSphere implementation: Arcade Nexus is an online video game store where users can browse, purchase, and discover the latest and greatest games. The website features a welcoming homepage, easy navigation, and a secure login/sign-in process. Users can view their username after logging in and explore a curated selection of games in a visually engaging, gaming-themed environment.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Header with Centered Title",\n      "description": "Displays \'Arcade Nexus\' in Times New Roman font, centered at the top of every page.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Navigation Bar",\n      "description": "Navigation bar below the header with \'Home\' and \'Games\' buttons, and a login icon button on the left. Hovering over buttons changes their color to orange.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Login/Sign In Flow",\n      "description": "Login icon redirects to a login page with a form for login or sign in. After successful authentication, redirects to the Games page and displays the user\'s name in the right corner of the navigation bar.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Main Content Area",\n      "description": "Homepage displays \'Welcome Gamers!\' and a brief description of Arcade Nexus. The background features a relevant gaming-themed image.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Games Page",\n      "description": "After login, users are redirected to the Games page, which maintains the same header and navigation bar, and displays the user\'s name.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2121ab",\n    "secondary": "#16213e",\n    "accent": "#c4abab"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The layout starts with a centered header at the very top displaying \'Arcade Nexus\'. Below is a navigation bar with a login icon on the left, \'Home\' and \'Games\' buttons in the center, and (after login) the user\'s name on the right. The main content area on the homepage welcomes users and describes the store, set against a gaming-themed background image. The login page has the same header and navigation, with a login/sign-in form in the center. The Games page also keeps the header and navigation, showing the user\'s name on the right."\n}'}",
